EmitNextModuleDoc
    Version: 1
    Language: en
    Format: STF
    Purpose: EmitNext — fallthrough emission (next in order)

    Function
        Name: EmitNext
        Params: state, b, bid
        Returns: state

    DependsOn
        EmitInstrs, NextInOrder, EmitBlock

    Reads
        b["instrs"]

    Writes
        state["out"]

    Behavior
        Emits the block instructions, computes NextInOrder(bid), recursively calls EmitBlock for the next block

    Notes
        Matches the fallthrough path in emit_block
